QUERY NAME: BO-PortfolioTime
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: OTHER

SQL:
TRANSFORM Sum(TimeCostCalcs.Cost) AS SumOfCost
SELECT TimeCostCalcs.Project
FROM TimeCostCalcs
WHERE (((TimeCostCalcs.Project) Like "*port*" Or (TimeCostCalcs.Project) Like "TG*"))
GROUP BY TimeCostCalcs.Project
PIVOT Left([JobCode],2);

